  "description": "Callback-style memory eval. Facts are planted across an early session and probed obliquely 1, 3 and 8 logical days later. Oblique probes deliberately avoid restating the planted keyword so a pass cannot be earned by lexical echo. One direct probe (T29) is kept as a control: if direct passes while oblique fails, the gap isolates missing query relevance in fact ranking rather than missing storage.",
